The MIT licence above covers the source of NoteLens.

One file is data, not code, and carries its own licence:
`src/ink-prototypes-odbl.ts` holds symbol shapes derived from the Hand-TeX
database (https://github.com/VoxelCubes/Hand-TeX), itself derived from the
Detexify training data (https://github.com/kirel/detexify-data). Both are
published under the Open Database License v1.0
(https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/), and that file is offered
under the same licence. No Hand-TeX source code is used or distributed here.
